  dialogueText: '"Sometimes you want to give someone a general greeting without focusing
    on morning, afternoon, or evening. In Ilokano, ''naimbag nga aldaw'' means ''good
    day. ''

    It is a general greeting that can be used to wish someone a pleasant
    day.'
